      190.29,
      202.97,
      373.41,
      214.31
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE PENAL CODE ( CHAPTER 19 )",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      226.97,
      401.9,
      250.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      262.97,
      401.88,
      286.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Penal Code(Amendment) Act, No. of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      298.97,
      401.88,
      334.31
    ],
    "text": "2.Sections 365and 365A, of the Penal Code (Chapter19) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) ishereby amended as follows:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      219.81,
      346.97,
      401.87,
      382.31
    ],
    "text": "(i)Section 365 in the principal enactmentis hereby repealed and it is amended bysubstituting the following section:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      394.97,
      401.89,
      454.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201cWhoever voluntarily has carnalintercourse against the order of nature with ananimal, shall be punished with imprisonmentof either description for a term which mayextend to ten years and shall also liable to fine.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      466.97,
      401.87,
      502.31
    ],
    "text": "Explanation: Penetration is sufficient toconstitute the carnal intercourse necessary tothe offence described in this section.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      216.81,
      526.49,
      401.88,
      549.83
    ],
    "text": "(ii)Section 365A of the principal enactmentis hereby repealed.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      213.81,
      614.93,
      401.87,
      674.27
    ],
    "text": "(iii)The intent of the legislature in enactingthis legislation must be considered asamending the provisions that makessexual orientation a punishableoffence.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
